 dashboard, AI bot with RAG, reports, automations and webhooks.
 .
 The stack runs in Docker Compose. After installing this package run
 "sudo mira setup" and then "sudo mira start". Full Persian guide:
 /usr/share/doc/mira/INSTALL.fa.md
